      "name": "Rishab Gupta",
      "created_at": "2025-12-30T15:10:26.070Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is a GST compliance validation , A document numbers cannot exceed 16 characters (including alphabets, numerals, and special characters like <code>-</code> and <code>/</code></p>\n<p>This applies to any document where e-invoice/IRN is generated.</p>\n<p><strong>Fix:</strong> Shorten your naming series</p>",
